# Unix line endings on every machine, Windows too. A Terraform heredoc (an IAM condition, an alert's
# text) keeps its line endings, so a Windows checkout would apply \r\n where others apply \n, and
# each plan would replace the other's. The shell scripts run on Linux (CI, the training VM).
*.tf  text eol=lf
*.hcl text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
